      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\"Labor Peace Agreement\" shall mean an enforceable agreement that complies with the requirements of the NLRA between a Covered Employer and a Labor Organization, the terms of which, at a minimum, shall require that the Labor Organization and its members agree to refrain from picketing, work stoppages, boycotts or other economic interference and that the Covered Employer agrees to maintain a neutral posture with respect to efforts by the Labor Organization to represent Covered Employees.",
